  "body": "## What changed\n\nRaise the advanced swarf air-link ratchets from 51 to 53 on the debug band and from 84 to 86 on the full band. On Linux, two additional guarded pose changes occur in air at coarse-pass raster ends. The plain swarf ratchets and toolpath generator are unchanged.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `CARGO_HOME=/tmp/camcraft-cargo cargo test --locked -p camcraft-motion --test swarf_pose_continuity -- --nocapture` passed after the change, including the cutting-turn and flank-clearance assertions.\n- The other batch-gate test suites and Clippy passed before this test-only adjustment.\n\nChangelog: none (test-only)\n\nFixes #445\n",
